# A Class's levels (CR 716): "{G}: Level 2" and "{3}{G}: Level 3" are activated only as a sorcery and each gains the next level only. On turn 3, with five untapped mana sources and the Talent at level 1: Level 2 is refused in the beginning of
# combat step (sorcery speed), and in main phase 2 Level 3 is refused (level 1, not 2), Level 2 is done, Level 2 is refused again (already level 2) and Level 3 is done (the positive control for each).

